{"answer_text":"Mobile apps vary a lot: some are full CRMs, others are read-only companions. The ones people rate highly on phones: [1]\n\n- **Northwind CRM Essentials**: Powerful and well supported, though per-seat costs climb quickly past the starter tier. [2]\n- **Halcyon Sales**: A sales-engagement tool with a CRM attached; sequences and call tasks are its strength. [3]\n- **Kestrel CRM Lite**: Promising and free to start, though the integration list is still short. [4]\n\nIn short, start with Northwind CRM if you want the quickest setup; shortlist Halcyon Sales if you expect to need deeper reporting.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50bb-73ac-bc5a-6c05900dd5ca","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:40.250Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["crm app reviews ios android","simple crm mobile offline","best mobile crm app"],"latency_ms":4660,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[125,138],[481,494]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[249,262],[537,550]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-5864-7406-ad9e-7a386e391e3e","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"llm","name":"Kestrel CRM","name_text":"Kestrel CRM","offsets":[[362,373]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","s